      "versionNonce": 961417282,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Runs concurrently with PII & Security scans\n• Embeds evaluated text via Ollama\n  (model: nomic-embed-text, 768 dims)\n• pgvector Cosine Distance Search:\n  ORDER BY embedding <=> CAST(:vec AS vector)\n• Filters policies by app data_classification\n• Graceful degradation: returns [] if Ollama down\n• Returns: {retrieved_policies: [...] }",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Runs concurrently with PII & Security scans\n• Embeds evaluated text via Ollama\n  (model: nomic-embed-text, 768 dims)\n• pgvector Cosine Distance Search:\n  ORDER BY embedding <=> CAST(:vec AS vector)\n• Filters policies by app data_classification\n• Graceful degradation: returns [] if Ollama down\n• Returns: {retrieved_policies: [...] }",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7Z"
