      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31476,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 92422430,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Runs concurrently with RAG & Security\n• PIIDetector.scan(raw_text) via 10 regexes\n  (Aadhaar, PAN, SSN, CC, Emails, Phones, Keys)\n• Generates deterministic findings (conf=1.0)\n• PIIDetector.mask(raw_text) → masked_text\n  (replaces raw PII with [REDACTED] tokens)\n• Output text scrubbed for downstream LLM\n• Returns: {findings: [...], masked_text: ...}",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Runs concurrently with RAG & Security\n• PIIDetector.scan(raw_text) via 10 regexes\n  (Aadhaar, PAN, SSN, CC, Emails, Phones, Keys)\n• Generates deterministic findings (conf=1.0)\n• PIIDetector.mask(raw_text) → masked_text\n  (replaces raw PII with [REDACTED] tokens)\n• Output text scrubbed for downstream LLM\n• Returns: {findings: [...], masked_text: ...}",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7c"
    },
