      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Phase-Aware Security Scanner:\n  - INPUT: InjectionDetector (jailbreaks, DAN)\n  - OUTPUT: System prompt disclosure scan\n  - BOTH: Credential leakage (sk-*, Bearer)\n• Emits CRITICAL findings for injection/creds\n• Truncates secrets in evidence payload\n• Deterministic confidence (0.85 – 0.95)\n• Returns: {findings: [...] }",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Phase-Aware Security Scanner:\n  - INPUT: InjectionDetector (jailbreaks, DAN)\n  - OUTPUT: System prompt disclosure scan\n  - BOTH: Credential leakage (sk-*, Bearer)\n• Emits CRITICAL findings for injection/creds\n• Truncates secrets in evidence payload\n• Deterministic confidence (0.85 – 0.95)\n• Returns: {findings: [...] }",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
