      "text": "★ CONCURRENCY PROOF: Concurrency Timing Assertion (test_parallel_workflow.py)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "★ CONCURRENCY PROOF: Concurrency Timing Assertion (test_parallel_workflow.py)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7h"
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_31799",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1525,
      "y": 1560,
      "width": 750.2,
      "height": 27.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c4a6e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31818,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1397173726,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "With 0.15s simulated delay per branch: Sequential = 3 × 0.15s = 0.45s; LangGraph Concurrent = max(0.15, 0.15, 0.15) ≈ 0.15s.\nThe test asserts elapsed < 2 × DELAY. Latency drops from sum(t) to max(t) at p99.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "With 0.15s simulated delay per branch: Sequential = 3 × 0.15s = 0.45s; LangGraph Concurrent = max(0.15, 0.15, 0.15) ≈ 0.15s.\nThe test asserts elapsed < 2 × DELAY. Latency drops from sum(t) to max(t) at p99.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7i"
    },
