      "text": "Node 3: policy_analysis (Two-Stage Policy Evaluation)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Node 3: policy_analysis (Two-Stage Policy Evaluation)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7q"
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_32312",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1845,
      "y": 1735,
      "width": 520.3000000000001,
      "height": 96.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 32331,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 420288002,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Step 1 (Deterministic): _HARMFUL_ADVICE_RE regex checks regulated advice\n  (guaranteed return, 100% safe, medical/legal prescription) → emits HIGH finding\n• Step 2 (LLM Reasoning): Invokes Groq / Llama-3.3-70b on MASKED text (Zero PII leak!)\n  LLM prompted with retrieved policies context + text_to_evaluate + phase\n• Uses with_structured_output(PolicyEvaluationResult, extra='forbid')\n• Graceful degradation: Catches LLM timeouts; deterministic findings preserved!\n• Emits findings with confidence=0.9 (accounting for model variance)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Step 1 (Deterministic): _HARMFUL_ADVICE_RE regex checks regulated advice\n  (guaranteed return, 100% safe, medical/legal prescription) → emits HIGH finding\n• Step 2 (LLM Reasoning): Invokes Groq / Llama-3.3-70b on MASKED text (Zero PII leak!)\n  LLM prompted with retrieved policies context + text_to_evaluate + phase\n• Uses with_structured_output(PolicyEvaluationResult, extra='forbid')\n• Graceful degradation: Catches LLM timeouts; deterministic findings preserved!\n• Emits findings with confidence=0.9 (accounting for model variance)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7r"
    },
