      "text": "Node 4: calculate_risk (Deterministic RiskEngine)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Node 4: calculate_risk (Deterministic RiskEngine)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7u"
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_32540",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1845,
      "y": 1945,
      "width": 496.1000000000001,
      "height": 82.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9a3412",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 32559,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 874315138,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Maps all merged findings to 4 risk dimensions:\n  data_risk (30%), security_risk (30%), compliance_risk (20%), model_risk (10%)\n• Calculates weighted sum: raw_score = min(100, sum(severity × confidence))\n• CRITICAL Boost Rule: If any finding has CRITICAL severity with confidence ≥ 0.8,\n  total score is immediately elevated to ≥ 80 (CRITICAL threshold)\n• Emits typed RiskResult with full mathematical breakdown",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Maps all merged findings to 4 risk dimensions:\n  data_risk (30%), security_risk (30%), compliance_risk (20%), model_risk (10%)\n• Calculates weighted sum: raw_score = min(100, sum(severity × confidence))\n• CRITICAL Boost Rule: If any finding has CRITICAL severity with confidence ≥ 0.8,\n  total score is immediately elevated to ≥ 80 (CRITICAL threshold)\n• Emits typed RiskResult with full mathematical breakdown",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7v"
    },
