      "text": "Node 5: governance_decision (Deterministic Decision Gate)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Node 5: governance_decision (Deterministic Decision Gate)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7y"
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_32768",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1845,
      "y": 2145,
      "width": 423.50000000000006,
      "height": 82.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#155e75",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 32787,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 855180546,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Evaluates risk_result against business thresholds:\n    - LOW (0-29) / MEDIUM (30-59) → decision = 'ALLOW'\n    - HIGH (60-79) → decision = 'REVIEW' (approval_required = True)\n    - CRITICAL (≥80) without exception → decision = 'BLOCK'\n    - CRITICAL with ACTIVE non-expired exception → decision = 'REVIEW'\n• Exception check is strictly time-bound (is_currently_active)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Evaluates risk_result against business thresholds:\n    - LOW (0-29) / MEDIUM (30-59) → decision = 'ALLOW'\n    - HIGH (60-79) → decision = 'REVIEW' (approval_required = True)\n    - CRITICAL (≥80) without exception → decision = 'BLOCK'\n    - CRITICAL with ACTIVE non-expired exception → decision = 'REVIEW'\n• Exception check is strictly time-bound (is_currently_active)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7z"
    },
