      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• User Prompt / AI Response is fully compliant\n• INPUT Phase: Prompt safely forwarded to AI model\n• OUTPUT Phase: AI response delivered to user\n• AuditEvent logged with summary: [PHASE] ALLOW\n• Zero user friction, p99 latency < 60ms",
