      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• User Prompt / AI Response is fully compliant\n• INPUT Phase: Prompt safely forwarded to AI model\n• OUTPUT Phase: AI response delivered to user\n• AuditEvent logged with summary: [PHASE] ALLOW\n• Zero user friction, p99 latency < 60ms",
