      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Requires Human-in-the-Loop approval\n• Creates ApprovalRequest (status=PENDING)\n• Workflow halts forwarding until authorized\n• Notification sent to DPO / Compliance Queue\n• Resolution: POST /approvals/{id}/approve or reject",
