      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790660852895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Severe violation (Prompt injection, Aadhaar leak, etc.)\n• INPUT Phase: Request aborted, user notified\n• OUTPUT Phase: Response suppressed, leak prevented\n• AuditEvent logged with CRITICAL security alert\n• Cannot be bypassed unless active exception exists",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Severe violation (Prompt injection, Aadhaar leak, etc.)\n• INPUT Phase: Request aborted, user notified\n• OUTPUT Phase: Response suppressed, leak prevented\n• AuditEvent logged with CRITICAL security alert\n• Cannot be bypassed unless active exception exists",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
