      "text": "1. Assessment produces REVIEW decision (Risk HIGH or Exemption applied)\n2. ApprovalRequest created automatically with status='PENDING'\n3. Assigned to DPO / Compliance Queue with context reasons\n4. Authorized Approver resolves via API or Dashboard:",
